The modules are intended to provide a helpful reference for students and beginners learning **GitHub and modern software development workflows**.

🎯 Learning Objectives
Through this learning plan, I aim to:
* Understand the fundamentals of Git and GitHub
* Learn how to work with GitHub repositories
* Understand branches, commits, and pull requests
* Explore GitHub collaboration and project management features
* Learn the basics of GitHub security and best practices
* Build a strong foundation for the GitHub Foundations certification

Upon completion of this learning plan, learners will be ready to prepare for the GitHub Foundations certification.

